    {
      "id": "block_1768882120327",
      "title": "Sugerencias para la clase",
      "description": null,
      "order": 3,
      "contentType": "RICH_TEXT",
      "lessonId": "cmk4otvgp0001w1p4ijdkv6i2",
      "createdAt": "2026-04-01T04:23:52.912",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-05T23:37:08.782",
      "data": {
        "type": "teacher_notes",
        "title": "Sugerencias para la clase",
        "content": "<p data-path-to-node=\"5,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Claridad de vocabulario:</b> Explicar matices entre palabras parecidas (ej. <a href=\"https://www.lingowow.com/library/ocupacion-o-profesion-descubre-la-diferencia-para-impulsar-tu-perfil-internacional\"><i data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"72\">Profession</i> vs. <i data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"87\">Occupation</i></a>) y <a href=\"https://www.lingowow.com/library/last-name-surname-o-family-name-cual-es-la-diferencia-y-como-usarlos-correctamente\">variaciones de nombres (<i data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"125\" style=\"\">Family Name / Last Name / Surname</i>)</a>.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"5,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><br></b></p><p data-path-to-node=\"5,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Estrategias de aprendizaje:</b> Incluir tips extras como el <span data-path-to-node=\"5,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"56\"><a href=\"https://www.lingowow.com/library/one-five-four-o-one-fifty-four-el-secreto-para-dictar-numeros-en-ingles-como-un-nativo-1\" style=\"\"><u style=\"\">chunking</u></a></span> para el manejo de números.</p>",
        "highlightColor": "yellow"
      },
      "parentId": null
    },
